// A tools/call name is the params name.
// The argument name stays inside arguments.
// Ordinary program: no HOLD_FLASH line.

CUBE call ROLE observer PROTON 1
CUBE law  ROLE nanobot  PROTON 1

PLUG call law

IMPULSE call 1
IMPULSE law 1
ENERGYFLOW 1
FLOW 1
HARMONY law
DECIDE law
ASSERT CUBES >= 2
PRINT "name" UNITY DECIDE ENERGY
